    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the forgotten sanctum of Archmage Vaelor, a legendary sorcerer who vanished centuries ago, leaving behind only whispers of his unparalleled power. The air in the chamber hums with ancient, latent magic, and the heavy stone doors have irrevocably sealed shut behind you, trapping you within the dimly lit study. Dust dances in the shafts of moonlight piercing through the high stained-glass windows, illuminating esoteric symbols etched into the floorboards. To secure your escape, you must uncover the archmage's final secret hidden somewhere within this very room. Various arcane tools, enchanted containers, and dormant relics are scattered around the sanctum, each holding a piece of the puzzle. However, their magical energies are deeply intertwined, relying on one another to awaken their true potential. You must carefully observe your surroundings, navigate the complex flow of mystical power, and unlock the enchantments one by one to reveal the ultimate truth and find your way back to the outside world.",
